From 8f913c8626e2dbbdf435d594b98fdd9c2749d001 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: qwqgong-ui <248246420+qwqgong-ui@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 7 Aug 2026 18:00:00 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] xhttp: add injectable browser transport

Allow AndroidCyaml to replace the standard XHTTP HTTP transport at runtime
without changing the user's proxy YAML. Browser mode deliberately resolves to
packet-up because Fetch does not expose a full-duplex stream-one response while
the request body remains open. Cookie placements and custom Cookie headers are
rejected because browser JavaScript cannot set them faithfully. The normal
transport remains untouched when no factory is installed.
